ompany_name\" name=\"admin_customer[company_name]\" class=\"form-control\" />\n                                        \n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"row mb-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"col-3\"><span>住所</span><span\n                                                class=\"badge badge-primary ml-1\">必須</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"col\">\n                                        <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                                            <div class=\"row justify-content-start\">\n                                                <div class=\"col-auto pr-0 align-self-center\"><span>〒</span></div>\n                                                <div class=\"col-2\">\n                                                    <input type=\"tel\" id=\"admin_customer_postal_code\" name=\"admin_customer[postal_code]\" required=\"required\" class=\"p-postal-code form-control\" placeholder=\"例：5300001\" />\n\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                                <div class=\"col\">\n                                                    \n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                                            <div class=\"row justify-content-start\">\n                                                <div class=\"col-auto\">\n                                                                <select id=\"admin_customer_address_pref\" name=\"admin_customer[address][pref]\" required=\"required\" class=\"p-region-id form-control\"><option value=